# Agent scratch, showcase and test output
# Folders a showcase run works in: the copied zornov binary, the stdio MCP
# client and its call files, the scratch project the app writes (media,
# music, sfx, Models, Vector, cache, backups), renders and frame grabs
/showcase-bin/
/showcase-out/
/showcase-proj/
/showcase-project/
/showcase-work/
# Projects the math film and showcase tests save, should their output go to the root
/Math shapes/
/Math showcase/
# QC reports written beside an exported file
*.qc.json
*.qc.txt
# Saved model meshes and baked motion
*.smesh
*.scache
# Flight-recorder traces (a project's .zornov/agent-trace/, an eval run's
# TASK/agent-trace/): tool calls and replies, never committed
agent-trace/
# Friction reports and live-tap dumps written next to them
friction-report*.md
tap*.txt
# Replay copies of a project, if TMPDIR points into the tree
zornov-replay-*/
# Finder files inside testdata, which the !/testdata/** line above lets back in
/testdata/**/.DS_Store
